<title>USA: Fleet Financial calls Series IV Preferred.</title>
<headline>Fleet Financial calls Series IV Preferred.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON, Mass. 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fleet Financial Group said Friday that it has called to redeem 1,915,353 depository shares, representing all outstanding shares of its Series IV 9.375 percent perpetual preferred stock.</p>
<p>The redemption will be December 1 for a price of $25.586 per share including accrued dividends from September 1, the company said.</p>
